{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-13_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-13","title":"不错的回忆","storyCode":"6-15","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-13_end.txt","sourceHash":"3f190341e53656b70969105d317d007a679fc752fc4cd29ec33dd7dbc4c610aa","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"率先被救出的霜星并没有对博士下杀手，只是期望双方不再相见。\n可是现实总是事与愿违。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（煌。我需要你带队建立优势。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"（你想组织一场突袭？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（我很担忧现在的情况。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（现在，我们和雪怪都依靠各自的手法确定了博士和霜星的位置。你的法术很成功，他们现在很安全。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（然而......两人的位置太接近了。只要能救出其中一个，另一个就会被一同救上来。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（有两件事情是我们现在没法确定的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（一是，会是谁先发掘出博士和霜星......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"（另一个，就是霜星的态度了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（没错。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果是我们获得先机，我们就必须立即制服霜星，但也要用她换取雪怪小队的认同。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（这样的话，我们不仅能避免战斗，也能获得更深层的交流机会。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果是对方先救出领袖......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"阿、阿米娅，心跳探测仪有反应了，我们确定了精确位置，深度还不确定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么急急忙忙就冲出去了，啊哟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"一牵涉到博士的事，马上就变得慌慌张张，甚至会把平常的习惯丢在一旁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"真不知道该说这是阿米娅她的缺点，还是她的特长......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你想，她刚才做的那些推测，根本不像是她平常会说的话。过于快准狠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，她没有走到偷袭那步。这个该我们去做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不完全是。现在偷袭雪怪小队，雪怪们一定殊死抵抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我的目标是营救各位，而不是造成我们更大的伤亡。她没放弃最优解的那部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......看来该道歉的是我。我佣兵思维太重了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"你也没直接动手不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"没有被近在眼前的战斗胜利冲昏头脑，而是坚守原本的战术目标，这才是我信任的作为战地指挥官的阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我去雪怪那儿看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"这结构......太复杂了，我有点摸不着头脑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你给我描述一下，我来作图。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我中学第八年级的教材都没念完，饶了我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你上课时候又干什么去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"训练去了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"要么你让大熊试试？他不是有那种法术吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"他是念念诗写写文章那方面的，和你这种结构探测是两回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"这样，你用算式表达试试，怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，还挺不错的，我数学还行，就这样吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你有没有感觉有点热？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"不是吧，我可是穿这么厚也感觉得到大姊的源石能把我冻掉层皮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你好啊，罗德岛的猫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我只要一流汗，周围就会变热，然后我就会继续流汗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"幸亏有你们，我感觉比平常凉快多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你很紧张吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"有一点。毕竟我没想到会和敌人共事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":".....至少现在，可以不把我们当敌人。挖出来大姊以后，她说什么我们照办，但那是之后的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们和其他整合运动真的不太一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"又有几个整合运动的成员是一样的？你会觉得你和那只小兔子是一样类型的人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯。你说的还蛮对的，我们这儿也是什么人都有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"到哪都一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"至少你们肯听我们说话，以前我们遇到的乌萨斯士兵，都是二话不说就射击的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"箭矢乒铃乓啷地射得到处都是，之后就是打起来，到一方死光了才结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟我们不是乌萨斯士兵，是制药公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"制药公司有你们这种装备？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"现在形势比较乱，大家都得有保护自己的手段，对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果能把这些打来打去的时间用来种地就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能多种一季红麦，就有至少半个聚落的感染者不用挨饿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是饥饿，他们也不会去那座小城，更不会被射杀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"如果，哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"别说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"他还挺多愁善感的。不，我觉得乌萨斯人都有点多愁善感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么在这偷懒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不好意思。该回去干活了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，你们忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你身上带着的那个，香味真足啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？这......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，有点馋啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你看我干什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"15:22 P.M.\n切尔诺伯格分城“14区”废墟\n区块地面\n挖掘作业三小时后"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，收手吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"你的手指已经血流不止了......！别再用手挖了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可我......我感受到情感了，就在这下面......就在这下面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"用工具的话，我感受不到......我必须用手指才摸得到那种细小的感觉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"已经很近了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"（陨星......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（可是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"（让她去吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果让他们先找到的话......如果让他们先找到的话！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，你能行的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"要用法术？我，我不行啊，这个我真不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"除了大姊我们就没人会这种类型的法术了啊？快点快点，只要把这两边的温度变得不一样就行，差距越大越好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我就试试......失败了可别怪我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"除了怪你，还能怪谁啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员C","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"别折腾他了，让他集中精神。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这里，就是这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......墙体？我挖错了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"对，只要打碎它，打碎它......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可这里坍塌的话......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......挖错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"打开了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"煌！陨星！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"做好准备。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你赢了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我会输吗？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你没有给我能赢的选项。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......这个人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"这个人就是罗德岛所说的博士吧。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"要杀要剐悉听尊便！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"你好。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的领袖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。可以叫我阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（她的戒指......戒指在变红？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（你不阻止她？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"（我没有理由阻止我们唯一的胜机。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陨星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"煌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我尊重阿米娅的选择。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅，不。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"大熊，罗德岛是不是没有和你们交战？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大熊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......那么在这片战场上，我们就不是敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"不是敌人就没有理由厮杀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"请回吧，博士。回到你的队伍里去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......不愧是大姊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小队成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"需要你夸吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"安静些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我叫阿米娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"你们也要前往龙门，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们迟早会是敌人，小兔子。只是，现在还不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星，你和你的小队并不像其他整合运动一样嗜杀、混乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"别指责我的同胞。你并不清楚他们经历过什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可你也不愿意看着他们这样下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎能看穿我的想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能。但我能隐约感受到你的不安和局促。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"这些都将在龙门陷落后一扫而空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛其实......能够理解你和你的小队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"也许你会反驳，会认为我根本不理解你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但霜星小姐，他们经历过什么，我清清楚楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......幼稚。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"霜星，你身上的衣服，不是你的吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。这曾经是“爱国者”的斗篷。我把它改织成了外衣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎么看出来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"算了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"每个人都会有自己说不出来的事情吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星小姐，罗德岛不想和任何人发生不必要的冲突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"又有哪种发生了的冲突是必要的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"至少我们不想与你的小队作战！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他们都是正直善良的人。伤害他们，或者让他们伤害无辜的人，绝对违背了我们的意愿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就祈祷我们别再见面吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能也没那么想伤害各位。但如果必要的话，我会把各位全都杀掉。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你可以来罗德岛。我们可以不再互相战斗。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"那你可以试着打赢我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你战胜了我，我可以考虑一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，我们只要在战场上相见，那就会是敌人。身为敌人，就是会互相残杀，不死不休。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，这个，给那只小狐狸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"治疗冻伤的特效药。独家秘方。至少能缓解烧灼感和疼痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我研究这东西很久了，刚才那一仗，你打的很不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"舍己为人的战士，在我眼里是最强的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，等等，那我也有要说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"雪怪1号！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"下次一起喝点！伏特加真够香的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪1号","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"别说出来啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"再见，罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"希望我们不会再见面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"龙门下层结构"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你果然会在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你好，霜星。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"你们好，罗德岛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["霜星"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["霜叶"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["陨星"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["杰西卡"]}]}
